*public/index.html* — too long to paste in full, but the only line that changed from the browser version is inside the analyse handler:

javascript
// BEFORE (browser version — exposes key)
const resp = await fetch('https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages', {
  headers: { 'x-api-key': 'sk-ant-...' },  // ❌ visible in browser
  ...
});

// AFTER (serverless version — key is safe)
const res = await fetch('/api/analyse', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({ refBase64, refMime, searchBase64, searchMime })
});


Everything else in the HTML (UI, canvas drawing, drag-drop) is identical. The zip has the complete file if you need the full HTML text.